{% comment %}
  6JOHAN Card Badges
  商品カード用バッジ（一覧ページ用）

  表示ルール（2026-11-22 Phase 1）
    - 販売終了（available=false）: SOLD OUT のみ
    - それ以外: 「セール / 残りわずか / NEW」のうち1つ ＋ 納期バッジ（最短7日・約2〜3ヶ月・約4ヶ月）
      ＝ 最大2つまで。重ねて商品写真を隠さない。

  使用方法: {% render '6johan-card-badges', product: card_product %}
{% endcomment %}

<style>
.card-badges {
  position: absolute;
  top: 8px;
  right: 8px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 4px;
  z-index: 2;
  pointer-events: none; /* バッジはカード全体のタップ領域を邪魔しない */
}

.card-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3px;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: 0;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.card-badge--in-stock {
  background-color: #5E7A5E;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge--backorder {
  background-color: #8A8A7A;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge--popular {
  background-color: #C4956A;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge--new {
  background-color: #292724;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge--low-stock {
  background-color: #D4804A;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge--sale {
  background-color: #A9503A;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge--sold-out {
  background-color: #6B6B5E;
  color: #fff;
}

.card-badge__icon {
  width: 10px;
  height: 10px;
}

.card-badge__icon svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}
</style>


{%- liquid
  assign is_in_stock = false
  assign is_made_to_order = false
  assign is_popular = false
  assign is_new = false
  assign is_low_stock = false

  # 新着判定（30日以内）
  assign now = 'now' | date: '%s'
  assign product_date = product.created_at | date: '%s'
  assign diff_seconds = now | minus: product_date
  assign thirty_days = 2592000
  if diff_seconds < thirty_days
    assign is_new = true
  endif

  # タグから判定
  for tag in product.tags
    assign tag_lower = tag | downcase
    if tag_lower == '即納' or tag_lower == 'in-stock' or tag_lower == 'in_stock'
      assign is_in_stock = true
    endif
    if tag_lower == '受注生産' or tag_lower == 'made-to-order' or tag_lower == 'made_to_order'
      assign is_made_to_order = true
    endif
    if tag_lower == '人気' or tag_lower == 'popular' or tag_lower == 'bestseller'
      assign is_popular = true
    endif
    if tag_lower == '残りわずか' or tag_lower == 'low-stock' or tag_lower == 'limited'
      assign is_low_stock = true
    endif
  endfor

  # コレクションから判定
  for collection in product.collections
    if collection.handle == '即納商品' or collection.handle == 'in-stock'
      assign is_in_stock = true
    endif
    if collection.handle == 'pick-up' or collection.handle == 'bestsellers'
      assign is_popular = true
    endif
  endfor

  # 在庫数から判定（タグがない場合）
  if is_in_stock == false and is_made_to_order == false
    if product.available
      assign total_inventory = 0
      for variant in product.variants
        if variant.inventory_quantity > 0
          assign total_inventory = total_inventory | plus: variant.inventory_quantity
        endif
      endfor
      if total_inventory > 0
        assign is_in_stock = true
        if total_inventory <= 3
          assign is_low_stock = true
        endif
      else
        assign is_made_to_order = true
      endif
    endif
  endif

  # セール判定（いずれかのバリエーションに比較価格がある）
  assign is_on_sale = false
  for variant in product.variants
    if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price
      assign is_on_sale = true
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{% if product.available == false %}
  <div class="card-badges">
    <span class="card-badge card-badge--sold-out">SOLD OUT</span>
  </div>
{% else %}
  <div class="card-badges">
    {%- comment -%} 1つ目のバッジ: セール → 残りわずか → NEW の優先順 {%- endcomment -%}
    {% if is_on_sale %}
      <span class="card-badge card-badge--sale">セール</span>
    {% elsif is_low_stock %}
      <span class="card-badge card-badge--low-stock">残りわずか</span>
    {% elsif is_new and is_popular == false %}
      <span class="card-badge card-badge--new">NEW</span>
    {% endif %}

    {%- comment -%}
      2つ目のバッジ: 納期（最短7日で発送 ／ 約2〜3ヶ月 ／ 約4ヶ月）
      判定は商品詳細ページの配送BOXと同一ロジック（snippets/6johan-delivery-badge.liquid）
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% render '6johan-delivery-badge', product: product %}
  </div>
{% endif %}
